    "raw": "Once upon a time, before the dawn of the Outcasts, all the Glitch lived peacefully together. They had their villages and castles and fields and all sorts of other things that robots like. They lived happily and prosperously, thousands of minds working together. But one day, a single Glitch walked into the castle, took a seat on the throne, and loudly proclaimed; 'Decisive. I am the king.'",
    "value": "昔在流放者黎明未启之时，全体电子人安居乐业，和谐无间。彼等拥有村庄、城堡、田亩，及诸般机器人所喜之物。生活富足康乐，万千心智，协力同心。然一日，忽有一电子人步入城堡，径登王座，高声宣曰：“决断。朕即为王。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The other Glitch stared at this unusual sight for a while, but did not know what to say. A self-proclaimed ruler was not something they were prepared for. As such, and with no real understanding of the situation , the Glitch were forced to obey.",
    "value": "其余电子人瞠目视此异象，良久无言。于此自封之统治者，彼等实无防备。由是，既未能明辨情势，众电子人只得奉命唯谨。"
